# CodeGraph keeps a live daemon socket at .codegraph/daemon.sock while its
# watcher is running. `vercel dev` walks the project to watch it, and a unix
# socket cannot be watched — chokidar throws rather than skipping it, which
# takes the dev server down at startup:
#
#   Error: Watcher error: UNKNOWN: unknown error, watch '.../.codegraph/daemon.sock'
#
# Nothing in there is source or deployable — it is a local index that rebuilds
# from `codegraph init` — so it should never reach a build either.
.codegraph
electron/
electron-builder.yml
client_secret_*.json
